OL,3,GNEWSAEvacuations after suspicious
OL,4,Aenvelopes found
OL,5,
OL,6,FPublic buildings, offices, homes and
OL,7,Froads were closed after two suspicious
OL,8,Fenvelopes were found at a council
OL,9,Fbuilding - prompting fears about
OL,10,Fongoing abuse.
OL,12,FHertsmere Borough Council said a 100m
OL,13,F(328ft) cordon was put in place by
OL,14,Fpolice after the items were discovered
OL,15,Fat the Civic Offices in Borehamwood,
OL,16,FHertfordshire, on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
