OL,3,GNEWSAEvacuations after suspicious
OL,4,Aenvelopes found
OL,5,
OL,6,FChris Gray, the cabinet member for
OL,7,Fcommunity safety, said the response
OL,8,Ffollowed not only the suspicious
OL,9,Fenvelopes but also a "serious death
OL,10,Fthreat" aimed at the council leader
OL,11,FJeremy Newmark, made in recent months.
OL,13,FHe said Newmark had been subjected to
OL,14,Fharassment from a "neo-Nazi" that
OL,15,Fsought to target his home.
